  "copy": [
    {
      "text": "It's almost embarrassing. We wanted to write about how affordable off season rates make city vacations here in",
      "x": 53,
      "baseline": 25,
      "width": 734,
      "size": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "the Spring. Victoria's gardens and antique shops. Vancouver's hotels and night spots. But then we got carried away by",
      "x": 9,
      "baseline": 42,
      "width": 778,
      "size": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "the thought of getting away from it all. Fishing lodges. The Inside Passage ferry. Guest ranches and of course kayaking",
      "x": 9,
      "baseline": 59,
      "width": 778,
      "size": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "about in spots like Emerald Lake in our Rockies. They're all equally within reach this time of year. So you see wher-",
      "x": 9,
      "baseline": 76,
      "width": 778,
      "size": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "ever you travel here this Spring, you'll probably be leaving some of our best places behind.",
      "x": 9,
      "baseline": 93,
      "width": 597,
      "size": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "For travel planning information write",
      "x": 827,
      "baseline": 17,
      "width": 265,
      "size": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "Tourism British Columbia, Department",
      "x": 827,
      "baseline": 34,
      "width": 265,
      "size": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "0804, 1117 Wharf Street, Victoria, British",
      "x": 827,
      "baseline": 51,
      "width": 265,
      "size": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "Columbia, Canada V8W 2Z2.",
      "x": 827,
      "baseline": 68,
      "width": 207,
      "size": 17
    }
  ],
